message: "If you use this software or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Edge-Magic Total Labeling Solver for the Four-Partite Family G(m,n,k,t)"
abstract: >-
  A constraint-programming (OR-Tools CP-SAT) solver and accompanying study of
  edge-magic total labelings on a parameterized family of four-partite graphs
  G(m,n,k,t), with algebraic necessary conditions, a vertex-determination
  reduction, a reference implementation, a test suite, and a visualizer.
type: software
